OL,3,GNEWSAChildren feared ride was 'on
OL,4,Afire', say parents
OL,5,
OL,6,FChildren had to climb off a ride at a
OL,7,Ftheme park after fearing it had caught
OL,8,Ffire, parents said.
OL,10,FAn eyewitness said there was a smell of
OL,11,Fburning while children were riding the
OL,12,FEgg-Spress family rollercoaster at
OL,13,FPleasurewood Hills, near Lowestoft,
OL,14,FSuffolk, on Saturday.
OL,16,FWayne Lennox, who had two children on
OL,17,Fthe ride, said they were "traumatised"
OL,18,Fafter a tunnel the Egg-Spress had
OL,19,Fstopped in started to fill with smoke.
OL,23,APub: 06-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
