OL,3,GNEWSAChildren feared ride was 'on
OL,4,Afire', say parents
OL,5,
OL,6,FIn a statement to the East Anglian
OL,7,FDaily Times (EADT), Pleasurewood Hills
OL,8,Fconfirmed people had climbed off the
OL,9,Fride but said there had not been a
OL,10,Ffire. The BBC has contacted the theme
OL,11,Fpark for comment, but it has yet to
OL,12,Fprovide any details of the nature of
OL,13,Fthe incident.
